<InfoPage title="Contact" kicker="Corrections and rights" description="How to contact GirlfriendGPT Guide about factual corrections, privacy, source updates, or rights concerns."><h2>Editorial requests</h2><p>Include the affected URL, exact statement or asset, reason for the request, and a primary source supporting the correction.</p><h2>Do not send sensitive material</h2><p>We do not need account credentials, private companion chats, identification documents, voice recordings, or intimate images to review a correction.</p><h2>Current route</h2><p>A dedicated domain email will be added after launch. Until then, use the <a href="https://github.com/zanderzou/girlfriendgpt-fun/issues">public repository issue tracker</a> for non-sensitive corrections and never publish personal data there.</p></InfoPage>
